# Scenario

If a user leaves a company its important to not delete their mailbox right away otherwise all the work they did on that mailbox is lost.

# Prediction
If i delete the mailbox on Admin portal it is lost, so it needs to be converted. If I remove the users license I will have 30 days to do this before the mailbox is gone.

# Implementation.
1. Convert the mailbox into a shared mailbox
2. Disable users login and revoke sessions.
3. Remove licenses

